/*--------------------------------*- Choupo -*-----------------------*\
  controlDict -- hda plant (top level).
\*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

application   choupoSolve;
tier         showcase;
description   "HDA plant -- toluene + H2 -> benzene + CH4.  A single FLAT flowsheet with two plant-level recycles (an H2 gas loop and an unreacted-toluene liquid loop); cross-sector tears are unsupported, so it has no sectors.  Furnace lumped into the isothermal reactor; the plant runs on SRK (phi-phi, kij = 0) because H2 and CH4 are above their critical temperatures, where a Raoult K has no vapour pressure to read; the shortcut column alone keeps the ideal package (see the flowsheetDict).";

verbosity     3;
